ss).\n\nThe most accurate description of Speaker 1 is frustration. Speaker 2 maintains a professional, procedural tone. If we must select an option where Speaker 1 is frustrated, only C and D remain. Since Speaker 2 does not sound sad (C), D is the remaining choice, implying the second speaker is also experiencing frustration, albeit masked by professionalism.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{D}$
