brary system in the United States was established, expanding access to literature.\n2. The audio does not mention the city where this establishment occurred.\n3. Therefore, based *only* on the provided audio, the location cannot be determined from the choices A, B, C, or D.\n4. Despite the lack of information, a choice must be made. I select C.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{C}$
